{"740690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plangman", "steam_appid": 740690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3567210], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plangman, you take on the role of a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Deluxe Edition of the game features extras such as an Epilogue, the Lost Levels, a two-player Challenge a Friend mode, and a text-based Level Editor.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plangman, you take on the role of a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Deluxe Edition of the game features extras such as an Epilogue, the Lost Levels, a two-player Challenge a Friend mode, and a text-based Level Editor.</p>", "short_description": "Plangman is an Apple II-inspired hangman platformer. Take the word-guessing of Wheel of Fortune, mix in Lode Runner-style puzzle platforming, add the storytelling of a text adventure, throw in a dash of physics, and--voila!--you have Plangman.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740690/57b8e4cc044d3d8697baec762906d0176f9e2df1/header.jpg?t=1775935117", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740690/07c7faaff2161cea8622d3536f160fa440c08020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775935117", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740690/07c7faaff2161cea8622d3536f160fa440c08020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775935117", "website": "https://plangman.com/",